Make FUSE 3 and PipeWire optional: new feature options "document-portal"
and "pipewire" (both enabled by default, so nothing changes where the
libraries exist).  Without FUSE 3 the document and file transfer portals are
not built (the permission store still is); without PipeWire the camera,
screen cast, remote desktop and clipboard portals are left out and not
registered.  OpenIndiana has neither library; for applications on the host
the FileChooser portal hands out plain paths and needs neither.

Not upstream yet; meant for https://github.com/flatpak/xdg-desktop-portal

